## Cohesion Check Complete: Khabib-Nurmagomedov.md

**Before score: 8.5/10**
**After score: 9/10**

### Central Thesis

Khabib is the rare Enneagram 8 who, instead of dismantling every authority, surrendered completely to one earned structure (his father, then the faith and family that outlived him), which is why the most controlling fighter alive could walk away at 29-0 and stay gone.

### Thread Map

Cold open (the tears he can't remember) → the paradox frames the thesis: control-obsessed fighter, operating inside a structure someone else built → **diagnosis** establishes the base type and pivots to the surrender-variant → **basement gym** shows who built the structure → **final say** shows why an 8 accepted it, ending on "built to outlive its builder" → **two Octobers** runs the controlled experiment (fury remembered, grief deleted) → **retirement** answers with the mother's word and the promise-as-territory mechanism → **now** hands the structure to Islam and distinguishes the 2023 plan from the 2020 promise → **sons** closes the loop with the bear-video reply withheld since the basement section. Every section serves the thesis; every planted thread (epigraph, "three words," memory hole, "two experiments running") pays off.

